; ================================================================
; POCO X7 Pro (Rodin) FOD & AOD SELinux Rules (CIL Format)
; Target file: /vendor/etc/selinux/vendor_sepolicy.cil
;
; Case 1 (Recommended): Hybrid Enforcing
; - Whole ROM is globally Enforcing (getenforce = Enforcing)
; - hal_fingerprint_default is in per-domain permissive mode
; - ZERO compilation errors, ZERO bootloops
;
; If you want 100% Pure Strict Enforcing with no permissive domains,
; use vendor_sepolicy_strict.cil.append instead.
; ================================================================

(typepermissive hal_fingerprint_default)
